.TH MOCHI-MANAGER 1 "2026-09-28" "Mochi @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mochi-manager \- manage desktop companion Themes and resources
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mochi-manager
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the GTK4 Manager. Saving a Theme edits its stored configuration.
Use Apply to change the running desktop Theme.
.SH FILES
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/mochi
contains user preferences and Themes.
.br
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/mochi
contains adopted resources.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mochi-sessiond (1),
.BR mochi-manager-legacy (1),
.BR mochi-purge-data (1)
